/* AD5 Sides 1.1.0 — spell target semantics + automatic allegiance.
 * Player side: player-controlled character/token, or native green marker.
 * Positive effects: same side. Negative effects: opposite side, plus player
 * allies bearing 001-karma-on or the GM-only hidden karma flag.
 * Direct damage remains unchanged. Individual targeted spells remain unchanged.
 * GM, selected tokens: !ad5-side karma on|off|toggle|status
